{"PageNumber":495,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":74,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ فِي عَذَابِ جَهَنَّمَ خَٰلِدُونَ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>رِمِينَ فِى عَذَابِ جَهَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَ خَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٤</span>","End":"٧٤","PageNumber":495,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":430,"MaqraNumber":198,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":75,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَا يُفَتَّرُ عَنۡهُمۡ وَهُمۡ فِيهِ مُبۡلِسُونَ","TajweedText":"لَا يُفَتَّرُ عَنْهُمْ وَهُمْ فِيهِ مُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>لِس<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٥</span>","End":"٧٥","PageNumber":495,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":430,"MaqraNumber":198,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":76,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَمَا ظَلَمۡنَٰهُمۡ وَلَٰكِن كَانُواْ هُمُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","TajweedText":"وَمَا ظَلَمْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ وَلَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>كِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> هُمُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>ظَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٦</span>","End":"٧٦","PageNumber":495,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":430,"MaqraNumber":198,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":77,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَادَوۡاْ يَٰمَٰلِكُ لِيَقۡضِ عَلَيۡنَا رَبُّكَۖ قَالَ إِنَّكُم مَّ