eNumber":80,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَمۡ يَحۡسَبُونَ أَنَّا لَا نَسۡمَعُ سِرَّهُمۡ وَنَجۡوَىٰهُمۚ بَلَىٰ وَرُسُلُنَا لَدَيۡهِمۡ يَكۡتُبُونَ","TajweedText":"أَمْ يَحْسَبُونَ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا لَا نَسْمَعُ سِرَّهُمْ وَنَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed>وَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ٮٰ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم‌ۚ ب</tajweed>َلَىٰ وَرُسُلُنَا لَدَيْهِمْ يَكْتُب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٠</span>","End":"٨٠","PageNumber":495,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":430,"MaqraNumber":198,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":81,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ إِن كَانَ لِلرَّحۡمَٰنِ وَلَدٞ فَأَنَا۠ أَوَّلُ ٱلۡعَٰبِدِينَ","TajweedText":"قُلْ إِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ك</tajweed>َانَ لِلرَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِ وَلَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>دٌ ف</tajweed>َأَنَا۟ أَوَّلُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨١</span>","End":"٨١","PageNumber":495,"JuzNumber":25,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":430,"MaqraNumber":198,"HizbNumber":50,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":43,"SurahIndex":"043","VerseNumber":82,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"سُبۡحَٰنَ رَبِّ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَرۡشِ عَمَّا يَصِفُونَ","TajweedText":"سُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ رَبِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضِ رَبِّ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَرْشِ عَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا يَصِف<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٢</span>","End":"٨٢","PageNumber":495,"JuzN